WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:03.170
- Mm-hmm. All right.
Hey, palsies!

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:05.380
My name is Cody,
and I'm a Helpster.

00:00:05.464 --> 00:00:07.341
That means a monster who helps.

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:10.886
And because I love, love, love
to help so much,

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:12.930
I'm making these videos called...

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:21.688
I love spending time with my friends
Mr. Primm and Scatter and Heart.

00:00:21.772 --> 00:00:25.609
But even when we're apart,
we still find ways to be together.

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.069
Like...

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:30.656
We send each other cards...

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:33.367
and handmade little presents.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:35.160
Heart sent me this painting.

00:00:35.244 --> 00:00:37.746
Hey, I'm wearing
the same outfit. Huh.

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:40.999
You can send your friends
and family cards and drawings, too.

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:43.919
Or you can talk on the phone,
or video chat,

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:45.754
or even read books to each other.

00:00:45.838 --> 00:00:48.590
Or you can do what my friends
and I do when--

00:00:48.674 --> 00:00:51.301
Oh. W-w-w-w-wait.
I'll show you.

00:00:51.385 --> 00:00:53.220
(phone ringing)

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:54.680
- Mr. Primm speaking.

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:56.974
- Mr. Primm, it's Cody.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:01:01.270
- My dear Cody!
Wonderful to hear from you.

00:01:01.353 --> 00:01:03.480
- Aw, you too.

00:01:03.564 --> 00:01:07.359
- Oh, wait. Let me get Heart
and Scatter on the phone, too.

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:08.944
- (gasps) Great.

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:10.112
- Hello!
- (gasps)

00:01:10.195 --> 00:01:12.281
- Heart's residence.
Heart speaking.

00:01:12.364 --> 00:01:14.867
- Oh. Heart and Scatter,
it's Cody.

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:16.076
- Hooray!

00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:18.078
- Hello, Cody, my friend!

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:20.497
- Hi, palsie!
Hi, buddy bud!

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:23.250
- And Mr. Primm remains
on the phone as well.

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:26.378
- Oh, great. Hey, is everybody
ready to make a new song?

00:01:26.461 --> 00:01:27.838
- I can't wait.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:28.964
- Oh, yes, yes.

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:30.090
- Yes. Yes, indeed. Absolutely.

00:01:30.174 --> 00:01:32.843
- Okay, great.
Now you all make the music,

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.678
and I'll sing the words.

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.346
- Ooh. I will start.

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:39.433
(beatboxes)

00:01:39.516 --> 00:01:43.353
(Scatter and Mr. Primm vocalizing)

00:01:43.437 --> 00:01:46.940
- ♪ It sure feels like we're together ♪

00:01:47.024 --> 00:01:51.612
♪ 'Cause it's all about reaching out,
no matter how far ♪

00:01:51.695 --> 00:01:54.656
♪ It sure feels like we're together ♪

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:56.825
♪ And that's because we are ♪

00:01:56.909 --> 00:02:00.913
♪ That's because we are,
that's because we are ♪

00:02:00.996 --> 00:02:02.331
- Oh, that was so great!
- Hooray!

00:02:02.414 --> 00:02:03.916
- Hooray!
- Huzzah!

00:02:03.999 --> 00:02:07.044
- You sound wonderful! Ha-ha!

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:09.630
Hey, thanks for watching.
I'll be back soon.

00:02:09.713 --> 00:02:12.341
And until then, see what you can
do to help the people

00:02:12.424 --> 00:02:14.009
and the monsters around you,

00:02:14.092 --> 00:02:16.512
because everyone
loves a helping hand.

00:02:16.595 --> 00:02:18.055
- Say goodbye, everybody!

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:19.515
- Great. Bye, everybody!
- Bye, everybody!

00:02:19.598 --> 00:02:21.141
- Bye! Fare thee well.
- Goodbye!

